        "link": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.02875v1",
        "pubDate": "2026-09-02T17:56:06Z",
        "description": "Convolutional Neural Networks (CNNs) have undoubtedly revolutionized image data analysis and the field of computer vision. As the cornerstone of CNNs, the convolution operation enables the networks to extract abstract features and uncover hidden relationships in the image data. This paper considers ",
        "title_cn": "通过广义Stein方法学习CNN滤波器"
